            <componentList xml:id="componentGrp_2bac4f51">
               <manifestation label="" xml:id="source_67eaf225">
                  <titleStmt xml:id="titleStmt_e7967e6c">
                     <title xml:id="title_fdedd1cd">Flauto traverso</title>
                  </titleStmt>
                  <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_7c251a91">
                     <extent xml:id="extent_24e7f0ca">2 folios</extent>
                     <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_27623afd">32.6x24.6</dimensions>
                     <watermark xml:id="watermark_66b58787">at the top right and left corner of fols. 1r and 2v a watermark is partly visible, consisting of the top of a beehive; no visible countermark. Paper of a fairly dense quality.</watermark>
                     <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_06439a17">In 2<rend xml:id="idm82" rend="sup">o</rend>; upright format; music (fols. 1r–2v); in all two separate folios, originally one bifolio. Hand-ruled paper, 14 staves (10 mm; 14-stave (?) rastrum used) in light brown ink and music in black ink; bottom three staves on fols. 1v, 2v have not been used. A clean copy with only very few additions and corrections in light ink, and only very few markings in pencil, presumably added in connection with a more recent transcription. Number of bars of each movement added at the final bars in red pencil, presumably of an earlier, most likely near-contemporary date.</physMedium>
                  </physDesc>
               </manifestation>
               <manifestation label="" xml:id="source_5a5eb12c">
